WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.505
Your coding agent

00:00:01.317 --> 00:00:02.366
can train itself

00:00:02.178 --> 00:00:03.085
while you sleep

00:00:03.606 --> 00:00:04.514
Songe is a

00:00:04.325 --> 00:00:05.457
training engine for

00:00:05.269 --> 00:00:06.341
your local model

00:00:06.481 --> 00:00:07.376
While you work

00:00:07.271 --> 00:00:08.131
it watches what

00:00:07.943 --> 00:00:09.063
happens after each

00:00:08.874 --> 00:00:09.581
of the model's

00:00:09.393 --> 00:00:10.089
actions

00:00:10.219 --> 00:00:11.209
the tool result

00:00:11.221 --> 00:00:12.105
the error your

00:00:11.917 --> 00:00:12.907
next message

00:00:13.438 --> 00:00:14.251
When your agent

00:00:14.063 --> 00:00:14.876
is quiet

00:00:15.065 --> 00:00:15.890
it teaches the

00:00:15.702 --> 00:00:16.574
model to see

00:00:16.386 --> 00:00:17.612
those outcomes coming

00:00:17.754 --> 00:00:18.379
and a new

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:19.239
version is used

00:00:19.146 --> 00:00:19.864
only if it

00:00:19.676 --> 00:00:20.949
passes its checks

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:22.602
Nothing ever leaves

00:00:22.413 --> 00:00:23.215
your machine

00:00:23.298 --> 00:00:24.111
and you install

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:24.583
it with one

00:00:24.395 --> 00:00:25.125
command

00:00:25.373 --> 00:00:26.528
uv tool install

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:27.106
songe

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:28.644
Full story on

00:00:28.455 --> 00:00:29.351
the dashboard
